# Removed by the PR that builds deno.lock (M9 PR 61): no format will be unbuilt after it.
# deno.lock is found by default detection, but its format is milestone M9. The error is the one an explicit
# versioned_files entry gives; the file is not dropped silently.
! exec remeris release --dry-run
stderr 'Versioned file format DenoLock is not implemented yet \(milestone M9\)'

